From 75bdbd3c3b10b4c39876c068185c700fb071a990 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 18:46:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: the lock screen's blur fades in and out

In a Lapin UX session the blur behind the lock screen's sign-in panel grows
from sharp to full strength over 200 ms (eased) when the panel opens, and
back when it closes, instead of switching in one frame. The lock screen
fades its veil over the same time, and those frames redraw the blur.

Refs #54

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Pcon9Yg6dsbuT1QQmuecS1
---
 src/backend/render/mod.rs                 | 21 ++++++
 src/backend/render/wayland/blur_effect.rs | 84 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 102 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/backend/render/mod.rs b/src/backend/render/mod.rs
